In the game, a few Iron Ores in your backpack or a few Firewood in your hands make you Encumbered: you use Stamina faster and walk slower, so you walk the same route again and again to move ore and wood. A single log in your hands also halves your speed, with no debuff tile on screen.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Lighter heavy items.[/b] Ores, ingots, bricks, planks, Firewood, logs, lumber, and other heavy items weigh half as much, so you carry twice as much before you get Encumbered.[/*]
[*][b]No half speed with a log.[/b] A log, lumber, Firewood, an anvil, or another large heavy item in your hands no longer halves your speed. Only Encumbered slows you.[/*]
[*][b]Your choice.[/b] Make items 1 (as in the game) to 20 times lighter, or set 0 to never get Encumbered. You can also keep the log slowdown of the game.[/*]
[*][b]Save safety.[/b] The mod writes nothing to your save, so you can remove it at any time. Made for single player: co-op is not tested.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]When Encumbered starts[/b][/size]
At the default settings, with nothing else heavy on you.
[table]
[tr][th]You carry[/th][th]Game[/th][th]With the mod[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Iron Ore (weight 4)[/td][td]11[/td][td]21[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Copper Ingot (weight 6)[/td][td]7[/td][td]14[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Firewood (weight 20)[/td][td]3[/td][td]5[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Log (weight 40)[/td][td]2[/td][td]3[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Thick Log (weight 100)[/td][td]1: Stamina depletes 180% faster, movement 36% slower[/td][td]1: Stamina depletes 30% faster, movement 6% slower[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]The Last Plague: Blight 0.12.7 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelastplagueblight/mods/9]BepInEx for The Last Plague: Blight[/url].[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelastplagueblight/mods/9]BepInEx[/url].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path example:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\The Last Plague\BepInEx\plugins\CarryMoreWeight.dll[/code][/*][/list]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Delete [font=Courier New]CarryMoreWeight.dll[/font] from the [font=Courier New]BepInEx\plugins[/font] folder.

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]BepInEx\config\com.ivmakk.thelastplagueblight.carrymoreweight.cfg[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-tlpb/tlpb-carry-more-weight/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

